BBEE AA CCOONNTTRRIIBBUUTTOORR
       Hey bro! I'm VI3E3E3W, the project maintainer. Thanks  for  using  GASH
       and checking out what we're building!

       GASH  is based on GNU Bash, so huge respect to Chet Ramey, the original
       Bash contributors, and everyone helping keep this shell alive.  I  also
       appreciate everyone contributing directly to GASH!

       Wanna help out? Here's the quest:

       1.  Fork the repository and create your own branch.

       2.  Make your changes and commit them.

       3.  Open a pull request on GitHub.

       Every  contribution  counts, whether it's code, bug reports, documenta-
       tion, or ideas.

       Thanks for having our back, bro. Much love! <3

       GASH is a fork of GNU Bash. Preserve upstream notices and  comply  with
       the applicable license when redistributing modified versions.

